Tèks lè: ['html'] fè: { <- (
		tèt-li
		ranplase: ['&'] ak: ['&amp;'],
		ranplase: ['<'] ak: ['&lt;'],
		ranplase: ['>'] ak: ['&gt;'],
		ranplase: ['"'] ak: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Lis nouvo.

['Verbatim Syntax'] karaktè chak: { :nimewo :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (nimewo), Letter: letter).
}.

Sòti list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list kole-ansanm: ['↵']).

Sòti ekri: template.

